{"name":"Piedra de Sol","hex":"#eac185","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"piedra","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A hair disease caused by a fungus."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/piedra"},{"term":"sol","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Solos."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["In a movable-do or tonic sol-fa system: the fifth step in a scale, preceded by fa and followed by la."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sol"}],"entries":[{"title":"Piedra de Sol","blocks":[{"text":"Piedra de Sol (\"Sunstone\") is a poem written by Octavio Paz in 1957 that helped launch his international reputation. In the presentation speech of his Nobel Prize in 1990, Sunstone was later praised as \"one of the high points of Paz's poetry…This suggestive work with its many layers of meaning seems to incorporate, interpret and reconstrue major existential questions, death, time, love and reality\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Aztec_calendar_%28Sunstone%29.png/330px-Aztec_calendar_%28Sunstone%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piedra_de_Sol","wikidata":"Q7191563"},{"title":"Piedra","blocks":[{"text":"Piedra is a hair disease caused by a fungus, which causes formation of nodules on the hair shaft."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piedra","wikidata":"Q10863066"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Aztec_calendar_%28Sunstone%29.png/500px-Aztec_calendar_%28Sunstone%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Aztec_calendar_%28Sunstone%29.png/1280px-Aztec_calendar_%28Sunstone%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Aztec_cal